"времени)"

#: package/analyses/mSRV.description
msgid ""
"Survival Analysis including Kaplan-Meier curves, log-rank tests, Cox "
"proportional hazards regression, adjusted survival curves, competing risks "
"analysis (Aalen-Johansen CIF, Gray's test, Fine-Gray model), time-dependent "
"covariates, and time-dependent ROC curves."
