#: R/mstab.b.R
msgid ""
"Tests equality of slopes across batches (Step 1; alpha = 0.25). If equal, "
"tests equality of intercepts (Step 2; alpha = 0.25) to adopt Model 1, Model "
"2, or Model 3."
msgstr ""
"Проверяет равенство углов наклона серий (Шаг 1; alpha = 0.25). При равенстве "
